window.products.push({"id":672018,"name":"Delta Children Batman Cozee Flip-Out Chair - 2-in-1 Convertible Chair to Lounger for Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81352oYqVMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Batman Cozee Flip-Out Chair by Delta Children is a cozy chair by day, laid-back lounger by night. This convertible seat easily flips open to reveal multiple ways for your child to relax--they’ll love to sit and read or watch their favorite movies on the chair but when it’s time for a nap, this seat folds out into a comfy sleeper bed. Plus, when the chair is flipped open it reveals colorful Batman artwork. Big enough to fit two small kids comfortably in chair mode, it’s light enough to move around the house and is ideal for your children to share during playtime or sleepovers. The super-soft slipcover with easy-to-reach side pocket is treated with a Scotchgard stain release finish to resist stains, ensuring the chair looks beautiful for years to come! The supportive foam construction will keep its shape and provides all-day comfort. Designed to ship in a super-small box, this lightweight foam kids’ chair and lounger may take up to 24 hours to fully expand once unboxed. Machine-washable slipcover zips off for easy cleaning. Recommended for ages 18 months+.About Batman: Dark Knight. Caped Crusader. Sworn protector of Gotham City. Batman goes by many names, but he has only one mission-become the world's greatest weapon against crime. His powers? Super-sophisticated gear and intelligence. Batman's utility belt and Batmoblie help him morph him into the ultimate vigilante. Made to KA-POW, Batman furniture from Delta Children adds cool style to your child's space while creating a fun crime-fighting ambiance that's perfect for pretend play.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81352oYqVMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Children","source_asin":"B093655WPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093655WPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093655WPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":672019,"name":"DEKIRU Acrylic Picture Frames - 5x7\" (2 Packs) - 24mm Thick, 20% Thicker • Magnetic Photo Frames • Frameless Desktop Picture Frame • Floating Acrylic ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a+0+gGnmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DEKIRU 5 x 7 inches Acrylic Photo Frames are highly easy to use and are able to standalone on your desk or table - without any tools required ! Also, we have provided 20% extra thickness (12MM + 12MM) compared to current market products for extra stability. The magnetic picture frame is held by 4 strong magnets at each corner. User simply needs to pull apart each block to insert/replace the picture in between. Great pride are taken for our frames and we sincerely hope you will enjoy using them. ⭐ PREMIUM QUALITY: Superior acrylic material are graded AAA and will not decolourise or turn yellow over time. Each block is extremely crystal clear and comes with UV Protection. The additional UV coating will serve to prevent photo degradation from sunlight. ⭐ STRONGER MAGNET: Our 4 corner magnets used are improvised version - STRONGER than most products sold in the market. Strength of the magnetism will be more than sufficient to hold 2 separate photos (double sided) within a frame. ⭐ EXTRA THICKNESS (20% Thicker - 12MM+12MM): Whether you choose to mount your picture in Portrait or Landscape orientation. We provide extra thickness compared to our retail counterparts. The thickness are tested and proven to allow sufficient stability and sturdiness for the photo frame to stand-alone. ⭐ HIGHLY GIFTABLE: Our photo frames will come with a Gift Box with protected bubble wrapping and PE bag within. Ideal and Perfect gift for your family, friends and loved ones to keep precious moment photos.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81a+0+gGnmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEKIRU INTERNATIONAL","source_asin":"B07Q37B7H5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q37B7H5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q37B7H5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
