window.products.push({"id":672128,"name":"ALAPUR Ladder Bookshelf Wall Mounted, 5-Tier Industrial Bookshelf with Metal Frame and Wood, Open Bookcase Storage Rack for Bedroom, Living Room, Offi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618z4irTeGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stable & Firm Structure】 The 5-tier industrial ladder wall mount shelf adopts a unique ladder splicing design. The wood board passes through the notch of the metal frame. It is not easy to turn over after being fixed with screws. The two thick iron pipes use four-sided pipes also to ensure its firmness 【Adjustable floor-protection pads】 The modern wall mount bookshelf is finished with two adjustable feet. They are helpful to ensure the ladder shelf to lay on the floor steadily. In addition, the adjustable feet can prevent ugly scratches from your floor surface 【Wall Mount Design】 The top of the ladder has curved elbows, which can be fixed to the wall with wall screws to ensure maximum stability. The back of the bookshelf is close to the wall, so that it is stable and safe. You don't have to worry about accidental tilting or shaking 【Easy to Clean】The flat wooden wall ladder bookcase with water-resistant surfaces are much easier to keep clean. It also can resist stains and anti-scratching for years, so that it is not easy to get dirty. You can simply use a damp cloth and mild cleaners to keep the table clean 【Large Capacity & Practical】Dimensions: 23.6in. x11.8in. x 72in./ 60cm x30cm x183cm. The size of the 5-Tier bookcase is perfect for the space you needed. It can be used as a plant stand, bookcase, picture and decoration display shelf or bathroom cabinet anywhere in your house, office and so on","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618z4irTeGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALAPUR","source_asin":"B09SZ2SVWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SZ2SVWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SZ2SVWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
