window.products.push({"id":672135,"name":"SHAPESHE Plastic Storage Bins Tote Organizing Container with Durable Lids and Secure Latching Buckles, Clear Stackable Foldable with 5 Doors and Detac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UV4ifGLUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💗FULL DOOR: The clear storage containers with lids have 5 ways to open the door. The top opening stores bulky items, while the side doors all around provide quick access to internal articles. The transparent view also allows you to quickly identify the items inside, which is convenient and fast. 💗STACKABLE STORAGE BINS: You can stack and combine storage boxes to save space. The grooves on the top allow the organizing container to stand securely when stacked, and the secure latching prevents items from accidentally falling, making the most of your wardrobe or other space. 💗STRONG AND DURABLE: Avoiding the cracking and deformation problems of most plastic storage bins, the polypropylene material of the collapsible storage bins is durable, and the stiffener design increases the shell strength on the bottom and sides, enough to withstand daily wear and tear. 💗FOLDABLE DESIGN: The totes for storage fold perfectly to 2.95 inches when not in use. the ergonomic handle provides a comfortable grab-able when moving or storing containers, The bottom removable pulley design allows you can to quickly move the case under load saving you time and effort. 💗STORAGE OPTIMIZATION: 56.39L large storage organizer for bedrooms, living rooms, attics, garages, offices, craft supplies, hats, clothes, holiday decorations, cups, sheets, toys, books, snacks, and tools provide the perfect storage space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UV4ifGLUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHAPESHE","source_asin":"B0BKZ3XD5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZ3XD5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZ3XD5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":672136,"name":"NOVICA Brown Animal Themed Suar Wood Sculpture, 7.25\" Tall 'Romancing Monkey'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PqZj59tYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Employing local suar wood, Nyoman Karsa skillfully carves this image of Balinese monkeys. The pair strikes a loving pose, embraced in an expression of nature’s intimacy. Subtle details complement the wood’s alluring grain. Imbued with ecological sentiments, the work offers a unique touch to any interior. Says Karsa, “Outside is the natural world; the lives of animals depend on human behavior. Numerous hunters travel around the world endangering the lives of animals, while only a few people concern themselves with finding the best way to save them from entirely disappearing. By creating animal statuettes I offer an alternative for animal lovers.” - Each artwork is unique -- wood grain, color, and pattern will differ slightly from picture About our Artist: Nyoman Karsa learned woodcarving from his father and the senior artists of his village. 'I have had my own work shop since 1987,' he says. 'I usually carve sculptures from ebony, suar, crocodile, and hibiscus woods. Each wood has specific characteristics of color, durability, and aroma. Some of my pieces deal with traditional dances, the stories of Ramayana and Mahabharata, sports, animals, and abstract figures. When creating a sculpture, I first see it in my mind.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PqZj59tYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00012A5DO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00012A5DO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00012A5DO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":672137,"name":"Compact Disk - Self-Adhesive Embossed Window Film Home Decor(Roll)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.08,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B05zgBNrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Decorative window film provides the look of stained glass, creating a very high-end look. Provides privacy yet allow natural light to enter the room. It can be trimmed to fit any custom size window. Each roll features an easy-to-peel liner and an adhesive that allows it to be repositioned during installation without leaving a sticky residue. Tough, durable and repels stains. Wipes clean easily. Ideal for specialty windows: sidelights, transoms, arches. This window film is a perfect gift for friend or family who enjoy decorating their homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B05zgBNrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blancho Bedding","source_asin":"B005B71DDU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005B71DDU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005B71DDU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
