window.products.push({"id":672139,"name":"ANZORG Hanging Baby Shoes Organizer Baby Headband Holder Closet Organizer for Baby Bow Socks Underwear with 30 Clear Pockets (GREY)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zdLcBEDUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NON-WOVEN FABRIC Baby shoe organizer with 31.9\" height and 16.9\" width. 30 clear pockets with 3.7\" D x 3.3\" W inch, design to hold 0-12 months toddlers' shoes(15 pairs). Please be aware that the pocket size is only suitable for baby shoes, not avaiable for adults' shoes. Baby headband organizer comes with one 360 degree rotating hanger, which can be hanged on the closet rod, cabinet rod and shelving rod. Ensure you to easily browse and pick holdings. Just takes up as limit space as a shirt hanging in the closet, save lots of room than storage box or drawer organizers. Use this closet pocket organizer to store everything you like for your baby, like socks, bows, headbands, jewelries, hair accessories and barbie doll accessories, etc. Transparent pockets make it easy to locate items even in a dimly lit closet. Can be folded to keep when not used, convenient and space saving. Versatile usages as hanging jewelry organizer, makeup organizer or electronic organizer. Used as jewelry holder to store earrings, rings, chains and hair accessories, etc. Used as makeup holder to store lipsticks, nail products and brushes, etc. Used as electronic devices holder to store wires, connectors, USB cables, chargers and adapters, etc. Christmas gifts or birthday gifts to your friends who just have newborn. Baby storage organizer is made of 90g thicken Non-woven fabric and clear PVC pockets, super sturdy and durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zdLcBEDUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANZORG","source_asin":"B0966BR3WF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0966BR3WF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0966BR3WF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
