window.products.push({"id":672238,"name":"MAGENTA Monterey by Citrine Canister, Lidded Ceramic Canister for Kitchen Storage, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i7kbW21dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevate your kitchen counters with this gorgeous stoneware-ceramic food canister with a lid. Made of durable real stone with a creamy white glaze, gentle ripples on the sides, exposed stone bottoms, and handcrafted accents, the Monterey by Citrine collection is the perfect addition to any farmhouse decor. With a classic, simple beauty, this decorative canister will become one of your favorite go-to storage containers.Our stoneware canister can be used as a coffee canister, a sugar-cube container, a flour canister, or even a cookie jar. This farmhouse canister makes storing kitchen essentials easy and neat while looking pretty on your countertop. Choose between our small, medium, and large canister for your home-ware needs. The small canister measures 6.25'' D x 6.75'' H, the medium canister is 6.25'' D x 8'' H, and the large white canister is 6.25'' D x 9.25\" H.Whether you choose our small ceramic jar, medium canister, large canister, or all three, these pieces will become essential storage containers for your counters. The timeless stoneware canister set is designed to last for years and makes the perfect gift for housewarming parties, wedding gatherings, birthdays, or holidays.Citrine is a home-ceramics company that collaborates with artists worldwide to bring their visions to your kitchen. We’re committed to creating thoughtfully curated, quality-designed goods that are functional and beautiful. We strive to create pieces that evoke feelings of warmth and comfort because we know home is where cherished memories are curated. Citrine ceramics are perfect for any sophisticated home that appreciates style and quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i7kbW21dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magenta","source_asin":"B0BKHQGYKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKHQGYKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKHQGYKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
