window.products.push({"id":672267,"name":"Blue White Cool Mist commercial grade humidifiers for bedroomTop Fill Humidifiers Quiet Cool Mist Large Capacity(10L/2.64Gal) for 56H, 280mL/H Max Mis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31flMM6GGTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[Commercial grade& Household Humidifier for Large Room] Up to 280mL/h mist output, holding 10L/2.6Gallons of water, the cool mist humidifier produces 56h of continuous mist humidity in a room up to 861ft² Preset 3 mist levels between low, medium and high moisture output for different rooms in dry seasons. Ideal humidifier for office, school, gym, senior housing, yoga rooms, bedrooms, living rooms and even plant caring in green-house! [Adjustable Humidistat &No Leakage] Built-in humidistat accurately detects the humidity in your room and automatically adjusts to your customized humidity level from 40% to 90% for comfortable indoor humidity. When the humidity reaches the preset level, the mist will be suspended. When the humidity is lower than 5% of the set humidity, the humidifier will restart. 360°rotatable Mist Nozzle for your multiple use. [Whisper Quiet, Sleep Mode & Water Shortage Protection] This large capacity humidifier operates below 35dB, which promotes a good night's sleep for the family, especially the baby! Low noise level will not disturb your relaxation, learning, working and sleeping. With clear panel display, you can know the real-time humidity level and settings at a glance. Display will shut down on sleep mode for a peaceful deep sleep.Auto-off mist output if your customized humidity reach or without water in it. [Top Filling, Easy to Clean & Separate aromatherapy box] With wide opening water tank for effortless refilling without any spillage, it provides easy access to clean the empty tank thoroughly just with a wet cloth. Add your aromatherapy tablets into the aromatherapy box and enjoy your undisturbed time. NOTE: please don’t use liquid essential oils directly for a long machine lifetime. [Top touch & 6M remote control & 1-12 Hours Timer] Sensitive touch control panel is easy to operate and the remote is very handy as you can control settings from a distance. Enjoy convenience and accessibility while customizing all the settings.Forget to turn it off before sleeping or heading out? Don't worry.You can set the timer to 1 - 12 hours as you like to suit your schedule and then the humidifier will shut off when time ends. No more waste of energy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31flMM6GGTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"blue white","source_asin":"B09HZQ6ZRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HZQ6ZRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HZQ6ZRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
