window.products.push({"id":672390,"name":"Nautica Kitchen Mat Cushioned Anti Fatigue Mats for Kitchen Floor | Thick Non Slip Waterproof Kitchen Mats and Rugs | Cooking & Standing Relief for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GKN9Gt71L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝗡𝗔𝗨𝗧𝗜𝗖𝗔 𝗪𝗘𝗟𝗟𝗡𝗘𝗦𝗦 𝗖𝗢𝗟𝗟𝗘𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡: Give your kitchen a classic and authentic update with the Embossed PVC Kitchen Mat Collection by Nautica Home. The anti-slip backing keeps your family safe while also protecting your kitchen mats for floor. These rugs feature an anti-fatigue cushioning construction that promotes better posture, circulation, and muscle conditioning while cooking, cleaning, baking, and other household activities. 𝗗𝗨𝗥𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘 𝗔𝗡𝗧𝗜 𝗙𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗚𝗨𝗘 𝗠𝗔𝗧: Durable high-quality construction helps keep this kitchen floor mat long lasting while looking pristine. The Nautica anti-fatigue kitchen rug collection is ergonomically designed: the kitchen mats anti fatigue benefits are enhanced with extra thick construction which provides comforting support and improve circulation. Built-in fade-resistant nonslip covering with skid resistant backing makes cleaning easy while providing non-fading protection to your floor mat. 𝗣𝗘𝗥𝗙𝗘𝗖𝗧 𝗙𝗜𝗧: These premium floor mats for home can be placed anywhere in your kitchen, your laundry room, or work areas in your house or apartment. The Nautica Wellness Mat is an excellent addition to your home office, especially at your desk for enhanced comfort when working – great for a standing desk! The surface of these embossed mats have an appealing visual texture, while the bottom features a non-slip base for support and safety. The Nautica Kitchen Floor Mat will elevate your decor and provide superior comfort. 𝗦𝗜𝗭𝗘𝗦 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗦𝗧𝗬𝗟𝗘𝗦: Wellness mats are available in a variety of sizes and stylish designs, so you can choose from many modern colors and a large selection of size options to find the right size for your home and kitchen décor. Size options include 17.5” x 32”, 17.5” x 48”, and 17.5” x 60” so you can mix and match for both practical and stylish coverage in any kitchen. 𝗘𝗔𝗦𝗬 𝗠𝗔𝗜𝗡𝗧𝗘𝗡𝗔𝗡𝗖𝗘 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗖𝗟𝗘𝗔𝗡𝗜𝗡𝗚: Simply spot clean these kitchen floor mats with a mild detergent and damp cloth. Do not machine wash. The waterproof nature makes them work as a great sink mat - built to last and provide exceptional comfort while doing household chores.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GKN9Gt71L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nautica","source_asin":"B09MJRJBB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MJRJBB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MJRJBB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
