window.products.push({"id":672467,"name":"Kooalo Agate Coasters- Set of 4 Unique and Beautiful Drink Coasters from Round Brazilan Agate Geodes.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L35fi0yHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Here's why customers love this stunning and functional decorative item: * WON'T STAIN FURNITURE. Unlike other coasters that are dyed or painted, these beauties are made from 100% natural stone, which means they will NOT leave color stains on your table, desk, coffee table, bar or any other surface. * WON'T SLIP. Each coaster comes with FOUR clear silicone bumpers on the backside, so your coasters won’t slip all over the table. (The bumpers stick strongly to the coasters, but can be removed with fingernails if desired.) * IDEAL GIFT. These make wonderful presents for both men and women, for any occasion, whether house warming, birthday or Christmas. They come carefully packaged in a beautiful gift-friendly box. * BUILT FROM AMAZING GEMSTONES. You're getting coasters made from an ancient natural gemstone that has been treasured for millenia. Most of the world's agate is born from ancient volcanic lava, and is characterized by its fineness of grain and bright, unique color patterns. They'll look amazing in your home, farmhouse or cottage! * NOTE! The edges are NATURAL (NOT GOLD) You risk absolutely nothing. Our coasters are backed by an unconditional 100% 1-year no-risk no-nonsense money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L35fi0yHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kooalo","source_asin":"B07GV2DGFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GV2DGFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GV2DGFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
