window.products.push({"id":672495,"name":"NEXAIR 36” Oscillating Tower Fan, 3 Speed Portable Fan Tower With Remote Control, Quiet Operating Floor Fan for Bedroom with 8 Hr Auto Off Timer, Slee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cS1b64aCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM TOWER FAN - This Nexair Premium Tower Fan, is created to cool a full room coverage with a 70° wide range oscillation, this tower fan powers 3 Speed settings and modes, for customized wind motion, it comes with a full functional convenient Remote control and has a Auto-off timer upto 8 hrs, its airflow is quiet, gentle, and extremely comfortable. QUIET & GENTLE ROOM COOLING - This Tower Fan is the best option for full room cooling, in addition it’s built to be quiet operating, with its oscillation to a wide range of 90°, with a super smooth, gentle and quiet breeze that will not disturb you from your sleep, work, relaxing, etc. Adjust all the fan features without any hassle with its fully functional Rome control. MULTI ADJUSTABLE SETTINGS - This Fan is equipped with multiple customizable features which makes it a super personal cooling tower fan, it has an option of 3 Speeds High - Med - Low, 3 wind modes Natural - Sleep & Normal, With an Auto-off timer where can set the fan to shut-off automatically up tp 8 hrs, What a great overnight cooler! CLASSIC AND SLEEK DESIGN - This fan is special designed with a sleek and classic look that will add a classy touch to your Home and office, its very easy to adjust the settings with it’s clear and easy button control with Led light indicators, It's very sleek, space saving, but powerful and effective, made of high quality durable material and standing on a strong stable base, this will keep you cool for decades. EASY & CONVENIENT - Control this fan with its fully functional remote control, it’s lightweight and easy to relocate the fan from one room to another with it’s special carry handle, the sleek design makes it a great cooling option to take along for travel, and is very easy and simple to assemble with NO TOOL needed, Its Bladeless design will keep it safe for your children and pets, and will add a cool relaxing gentle breeze to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cS1b64aCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEXAIR","source_asin":"B0BB4WDYR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB4WDYR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB4WDYR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":672496,"name":"Butter Dish, Imitation Ceramics Butter Keeper Container with Wooden Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51P4YzXS7AL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The imitation ceramic butter dish with a wooden lid as a cutting board and also a silicon ring seal, which is perfect for keeping the butter fresh! AIRTIGHT DESIGN - Butter easily absorbs the odors of other foods and the air is the source of turning butter rancid, so it's vitally important to provide a guard against this possibility. Wooden Lid with Silicone Ring Seal - Dust-proof and spilling resistant. The lid has a silicone ring seal,it can effectively enhance the sealing of the butter box,ensuring quality and freshness of butter stored. Multi-Function Wooden Lid - The ceramic butter dish with a bamboo lid as a cutting board,you can cut the butter directly on the lid, no need for other tools, so convenient and practical! Not Just a Butter Container - For kitchen storage, you can use it to store sugar, salt, spices or seasoning; if you are a baking lover, you can use it to bake your favorite small cake, potato gratin or other desserts SPECIFICATION SIZE: 4.3inch*3inch*2.75inch(250ml) Material: High-grade imitation porcelain, melamine material Capacity: 250ML/250g butter Weight: 280g PRECAUTIONS FOR USE: Microwave oven is not available, heat resistant temperature is 120 degrees - minus 20 degrees, can be used in dishwasher, 70 degree disinfection cabinet, ordinary soft cloth cleaning What’s in the box? 1*butter dishes ◆Note If received any broken items, please don't hesitate to contact us through our store page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51P4YzXS7AL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Little World","source_asin":"B07KRZPHW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KRZPHW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KRZPHW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
