window.products.push({"id":672500,"name":"KGOPTY Digital Meat Thermometer, IPX7 Waterproof Instant Read Food Thermometer Probe, Deep Fry Meat BBQ Grilling Cooking Kitchen Thermometers, Probe T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NC5cXQClL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍖[Rapid Temperature Measurement in 3-5 Seconds] Insert the long folding probe into the food or liquid, the temperature can be quickly read in 3-5 seconds to avoid undercooking or over-cooking of steak, barbecue, turkey, pork, chicken, candy or coffee, etc. Meet your needs perfectly. 🍖[IPX7 Waterproof & Built-in Magnets] This wireless kitchen thermometer is made of durable ABS plastic material. With high-level IPX7 rated waterproof function, you are not afraid of water ingress. There are 2 magnets built into the back of the digital meat thermometer, which can be attached to refrigerator, grill, and oven, etc. It is very convenient to take and storage. 🍖[Bottle Opener & Backlight Design] The BBQ thermometer has a large hanging hole, which can be hung with the kitchen utensils when it is not in use. This hanging hole is also a bottle opener, which you can use to open beer and enjoy it with the cooked food. The LCD display of the meat thermometers for cooking and grilling have a back light design. No matter day or night, you can read the temperature clearly from the orange light when you press the button of the bulb and the backlight turns on. 🍖[Foldable Probe & Automatic Shutdown] The stainless steel probe of the oven thermometer can be folded 180°, and it also has the function of turning on and off. The thermometer turns on when unfolded, and turns off when folded. If you do not use any buttons over 10 minutes, the meat thermometers for cooking will automatically shut down, which can save battery power. 🍖[Large Temperature Measurement Range & Switch Temperature] The temperature measurement range of the meat thermometers for grilling and smoking is -58°F~572°F (-50°C~300°C). You can switch between °F and °C by pressing the temperature button.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NC5cXQClL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KGOPTY","source_asin":"B099RTD6DG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099RTD6DG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099RTD6DG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
