window.products.push({"id":672733,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser, WSONVO Touchless Hand Soap Dispenser with Adjustable Volume, Upgraded Infrared Sensor, Handsfree Soap Dispenser for Kids Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yGmWU-wgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless] Adopted with an advanced infrared sensor, this foaming soap dispenser can detect your hand accurately within 2.36\" and dispense foam quickly in 0.2s. Fully automatic touchless features can avoid cross infection efficiently. The soap dispenser will stop dispensing immediately when your hands leave the sensor. [2 Adjustable Foam Level] Designed with 2-Level adjustable foam output, this automatic soap dispenser can meet the different needs of children and adults. Easy to use, one button to control, adjust as you like. Compared with liquid soap dispensers, this foam soap dispenser dispenses richer and thicker foam, which will help to save rinsed time, soap, and water. [Compatible with Various Soaps] WSONVO hand soap dispenser is suitable for most kinds of liquid. For Foam Soap, pour it into the tank and use it directly. For Regular Liquid Detergents, pls dilute the soap with water in a ratio of 1: 3-5 first, and stir it well to get perfect foam. Comes with 9.5oz/280ml large capacity and transparent visible container, this touchless soap dispenser can avoid frequent refills and allow you to easily see the left liquid level. [Waterproof & Safe Design] With a high sealing rubber ring in the battery compartment, this bathroom soap dispenser with IPX4 waterproof technology effectively prevents soap or water from corroding the battery compartment and then extends the product life. The tank can screw into the main unit stable securely, no need to worry about falling out when you move the soap dispenser around. Easy to Install and secure to use. [High-Quality Material & Durable] Manufactured with high-quality ABS+PC and plastic, This foaming hand soap dispenser is very durable and easy to clean. The new advanced non-drip spout offers more beautiful foam and minimizes clogging. [Soap Dispenser for Multiple Scenes] This soap dispenser operates on 4 AA Alkaline batteries (not included), which can be used on any occasion without limits on the power outlet. A compact design, perfect for home, hotel, school, office, and other places. 2-year quality assurance and lifetime professional service are offered, please reach out to us if any help is in need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yGmWU-wgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WSONVO","source_asin":"B0C4FC82K2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4FC82K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4FC82K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":672734,"name":"Urbalabs Western Rustic Barbwire Six Shooter Pistol Wall Hooks Coat or Key Holder Wall Hook Mounted Decorative for Hats, Coats, Towels, Mudroom, Rusti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J3cDY2bVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE DESIGN - Vintage, unique design - Our Beautiful Barbwire and Pistol Wall hangers can be a great addition to your home décor, simply captures the attention of any one who sees it. Our unique key hangers have a classic touch to them. They are very attractive and make your entryway, hallway or door look very charming. This is the way to wow your guests and yourself. Great Coat hooks for wall and keys. THE USE - Never loose your keys or coat again - These beautiful rustic western style wall mounted coat hooks are perfect for hanging in any room of the home. Great as well in the bathroom for some beautiful rustic western decor. Perfect for Keys, Towels, Coats or anything else you need to hang up! THE CRAFT - High quality, solid, heavy duty product - The Coat / key hooks are made from Heavy Duty Polyresin and are treated with special coating, giving the item vintage or rustic look, while protecting the item from rust and wear. You will see and feel the quality of these wall key / coat hooks as soon as you open the package. This solid Metal Key Rack will serve your family for generations. THE INSTALL - Easy to mount, easy to use - The wall mounted key hanger can be attached to a wall or on the entrance door with included screws and anchors. Just find the right spot, measure, level... and screw it into your wall. The Beautiful hooks are solid, yet slim enough for most key chains, Towels and Strong enough to be a great Coat Rack. SIZING: This Rustic Hunting Wall Decor Wall Hooks Measures 10\" x 5.5\" inches and has Three Hooks that measure a 2. 1/4\" long. Perfect size for any any Man cave, Bar, Bedroom or Bathroom. Great Country Towel Hooks Decor for anyone who loves to show some cowboy theme! Very Cool western coat rack For Men and Women! Crafted from Polyresin!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J3cDY2bVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urbalabs Nutrition","source_asin":"B08VHPLTN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VHPLTN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VHPLTN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
