window.products.push({"id":672794,"name":"Digital Alarm Clock with Power Adapter 6.2\" Large Mirror LED Clock with Auto Dimmer Mode and Easy Snooze Function Dual USB Ports Modern Decoration Ala","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VTsQRXECL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"⏲ 3 Level Adjustable Brightness & Night Mode： Our digital alarm clock provides 3-level brightness,adjust by manual or auto to a comfortable brightness and the LED light will automatically dim during your sleep time to protect your eyes at night and save energy, better for your eyes and more environmentally friendly. Night mode means that the LED automatically enters the lowest brightness display state at night,don't affect your sleep. ⏲ Dual USB Charging Ports & Battery Backup：Equipped with a power adapter and two USB charging ports on the digital alarm clock,you can charge cellphone,tablets and other electronics devices simultaneously when you charge the clock. No need to worry about low battery when you play your phone on the bed, very convenient for life.The backup power battery can keep the time and various settings unchanged in the event of a power failure. ⏲ Snooze Function：Big snooze button helps you to easily turn off the buzzer without opening eyes, allowing you to get 5 to 60 minutes (settable) of extra sleep timeand, but simultaneously prevent oversleeping. The digital clock will alarm every 5 minutes until you turn off the snooze mode by pressing any other buttons, perfect for heavy sleepers. ⏲ Detachable Base & Wall Hanging Hold ：When the clock is installed on the base, it's a desk clock, for desk,bedside,dressing, and we equipped with 6pcs base double Side Adhesive Tape to fix the clock without shifting ; When the clock is removed from the base, it's a wall clock, which can be installed on the wall through the hanging hole on the back , for bedroom,Office,living room, kitchen. ⏲ Large Display & Modern Digital Mirror ：The large display make you catch the time from the distance, even for some peoplewho are in glasses can see the time at night without glasses, which is so convenient.And the clock Made with PMMA material, It can also be used as a vanity mirror,which is beautiful and fashionable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VTsQRXECL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maison-Market","source_asin":"B09QKVRBPN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QKVRBPN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QKVRBPN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
