window.products.push({"id":672810,"name":"Bottle Openers, Portable Retractable Tool for Bottle Open,Travel Carrying,Hotel Application,Party,Barbecue,Mountaineering Outdoor,Wedding Wine Openers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SluuOkzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Metal Structure and Retractable Function of VABBON Bottle Opener】 -- VABBON retractable bottle opener has retractable design, which is not only convenient to use, but also can avoid the loss of the bottle opener, or it needs to be searched for the next use after it is used up. The whole body metal casting increases the service life, and also makes the vabbon bottle opener have a more solid structure. 【The Most Distinctive Design of VABBON Bottle Opener】 -- VABBON retractable bottle opener uses more tough metal cable, which is a kind of raw material used in construction and large-scale sea fishing. Escort for safe use. 【What's on the BACK of the VABBON Bottle Opener】 -- In order to expand the scope of use and adapt to more scenarios, two binding methods are added on the back of the vabbon bottle opener. It can be clipped to a belt or backpack, or hung anywhere. 【Where to Use VABBON Bottle Opener】-- Beer, Party, Barbecue, Home, Travel, Mountaineering, Outdoor Camping, etc. As long as there is happiness and celebration, there is a need to use the vabbon bottle opener.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SluuOkzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VABBON","source_asin":"B08V4TYDRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V4TYDRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V4TYDRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":672811,"name":"ROCKSLY Mixology Bartender Kit and Cocktail Shaker Set for Drink Mixing | Mixology Set with 6 Bar Set Tools and Bamboo Stand Makes It The Perfect Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VU4Vevv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ Unique Bar Set With Stand - The triangular bamboo bar tool stand not only organizes your tools, but also presents them in an easy-to-admire staggered setting. Wow your guests with your assortment of elegant stainless steel bar tools. ✔ Giftable Bar Kit - The perfect present for your favorite home bartender! This bar tool assortment is everything they need to get started - and get talented. Don’t overspend on unnecessary, showy bar tools that just get in the way. Gift the bartender set that every amateur mixologist needs. ✔ Elegant Organization - No more bar tool junk drawer, no more scratched bar tools! This triangular wooden bar stand organizes your bar supplies, keeping them clean, separate, and scratch-free. Never lose another tool! You’ll always know exactly where to reach for your home bar tools, even when you’re the middle of mixing up a pro cocktail. ✔ All The Essentials - Become the bartender you’ve always wanted to be! With this 6-piece cocktail set you’ll have all the tools you need to succeed: cobbler shaker, strainer, 30/60 ml double jigger, bar spoon, ice tongs, and bottle opener. The three-piece cobbler shaker with built-in strainer is easy to use, and the collection of bar tools is specially curated to enable you to perfect your mixology craft. ✔ Tough-As-Stainless-Steel Tools - Real mixologists don’t use flimsy tools! Shake, mix, and pour with impressively durable cocktail tools. These bartender tools are built from SS304 silver stainless steel alloy. They’re dishwasher-safe, heavily rust-resistant, and designed to last your entire amateur bar career.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VU4Vevv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROCKSLY","source_asin":"B09LSP6F6V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LSP6F6V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LSP6F6V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
