window.products.push({"id":672828,"name":"Legare 43-Inch Hutch, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D6gOse5jL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description 43\" Hutch in espresso finish, fits on any Legaré Desk Amazon.com A fresh take on modular furniture, Legaré offers stylish curvilinear designs crafted of materials that assemble and rearrange with unparalleled ease. In just three minutes or less with no tools, screws, or bolts needed, individual components lock snugly together to become sturdy, stable office and home pieces that will provide many years of high-quality service. Legaré's Select line is made of engineered composite wood with solid-wood surface veneers. Engineered wood, manmade from small wood pieces and adhesives, has several environmental advantages: large panels of wood can be made from small-diameter trees; the use of wood scraps and wood with defects reduces waste; and engineered products are often stronger and less prone to warping from humidity than solid timber. Plus, all the wood Legaré uses is certified by the Forest Stewardship Council. This 43-inch hutch attaches to any Legaré straight desk and features a reversible asymmetric design that allows plenty of configuration options. From left to right, the large and small shelves can be flip-flopped to position the opening for a computer where the user sits. They can also be turned to make the center opening even larger. From top to bottom, one of the wide shelves can either be installed at the bottom to support a desktop monitor with a keyboard underneath, or it can go at the top to make space for a laptop. It's like a big puzzle! The hutch also has conveniently placed cutouts for concealed cable management and fits securely on the back riser of the desk. Available in an ash veneer with an Espresso finish and an oak veneer with a Wheat finish, it requires only three minutes to assemble and a few seconds to disassemble. All Legaré furniture is backed by a three-year warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D6gOse5jL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Legar","source_asin":"B0019D3HIE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-672828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0019D3HIE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0019D3HIE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
